  <!-- Article 4 grants extra non-working days by declared religion or ethnicity, never
       by territory: an Albanian in Skopje gets 22 November, a Macedonian in Tetovo does
       not. These communities are geographically concentrated, which makes this look
       territorial, but the law has no geographic criterion, so none of Article 4 is
       modelled as a subdivision. -->

